This product is a JavaScript port of Botok, the Tibetan word tokenizer
developed by OpenPecha (formerly Esukhia).

  Botok
  Copyright (C) 2019-2025 OpenPecha
  https://github.com/OpenPecha/Botok
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The tokenization algorithm, the character and chunk handling, the trie
structure and the Sanskrit syllable detection in src/ are translated from the
Python source of Botok. Changes made by this port: the code was rewritten in
JavaScript (ES modules) and the API was adapted to JavaScript conventions.

The bundled dictionary in data/ was generated from the "general" dialect pack
of botok-data (https://github.com/Esukhia/botok-data), the word lists
maintained by Esukhia / OpenPecha for use with Botok. botok-data does not
declare a licence of its own; see README.md.
